<title>JAPAN: Musashino Kogyo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Musashino Kogyo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.87		vs	    2.99</p>
<p> Operating	  244    million	  vs	  345    million</p>
<p> Current	     57    million	  vs	  133    million</p>
<p> Net		   20    million	  vs	   14    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.91 yen	  vs	    1.34 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Musashino Kogyo Co Ltd is a long-established movie theatre operator.</p>
</text>
